  "id": "sesame-pasta-chicken-salad",
  "name": "Sesame Pasta Chicken Salad",
  "subtitle": "A chilled pasta salad with sesame dressing, chicken, and fresh herbs.",
  "description": "Cooked bow tie pasta is cooled and tossed with a tangy sesame dressing, shredded chicken, cilantro, and green onion.",
